<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Verifikasi Email - Lentera Sosmed</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Roboto', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d4ed8 0%, #2563eb 100%);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 550px;
    }

    .container {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(29, 78, 216, 0.4);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d4ed8 0%, #3b82f6 100%);
      padding: 50px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .header::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -50%;
      right: -10%;
      width: 300px;
      height: 300px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .header-icon {
      font-size: 60px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .header h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin: 0;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .header-subtitle {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 40px 35px;
    }

    .greeting {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #1a202c;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .greeting strong {
      color: #1d4ed8;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .message {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #4a5568;
      margin: 16px 0;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .cta-button {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 18px 30px;
      background-color: #2563eb;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 17px;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 32px 0;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.45);
    }

    .cta-hint {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #718096;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: -18px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .secondary-text {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #718096;
      margin: 24px 0 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .link-box {
      background-color: #f7fafc;
      border: 1px dashed #cbd5e0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 12px;
      word-break: break-all;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #4a5568;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      line-height: 1.6;
      max-height: 70px;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }

    .info-box {
      background: #eff6ff;
      border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 28px 0;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #1e40af;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .footer {
      background-color: #f7fafc;
      padding: 24px 35px;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }

    .footer-text {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #718096;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .footer-brand {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #a0aec0;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="container">

      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="header">
        <div class="header-icon">📧</div>
        <h1>Verifikasi Email</h1>
        <p class="header-subtitle">Satu langkah lagi sebelum akun Anda resmi aktif</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="content">
        <div class="greeting">
          Halo <strong>{{ name }}</strong> 👋
        </div>

        <div class="message">
          Selamat datang di <strong>Lentera Sosmed</strong>! Akun Anda baru saja dibuat.
          Untuk mengaktifkan akun dan masuk ke Beranda Lentera, silakan klik kotak biru di bawah ini:
        </div>

        <!-- CTA Kotak Biru -->
        <a href="{{ link }}" class="cta-button">
          ✅ Verifikasi Email Saya
        </a>
        <div class="cta-hint">
          Klik tombol ini untuk langsung masuk ke Beranda Lentera
        </div>

        <div class="secondary-text">
          Atau salin dan tempel link berikut ke browser Anda:
        </div>
        <div class="link-box">{{ link }}</div>

        <div class="info-box">
          ℹ️ Akun Anda belum resmi terdaftar di Lentera Sosmed sampai email ini diverifikasi.<br>
          Jika Anda tidak merasa membuat akun, abaikan email ini.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <div class="footer">
        <p class="footer-text">
          Demi keamanan akun Anda, jangan bagikan link ini kepada siapa pun.
        </p>
        <p class="footer-brand">
          © 2026 <strong>Lentera Sosmed</strong> — All rights reserved
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
